spell/hy.utf-8.spl -- Neovim spell file for Eastern Armenian

Compiled by spell/build-hy.sh with Neovim's :mkspell from the Hunspell
dictionary "dictionary-hy":

  https://github.com/wooorm/dictionaries/tree/8cfea406b505e4d7df52d5a19bce525df98c54ab/dictionaries/hy

which wooorm/dictionaries generated from araktransfer:

  https://sites.google.com/site/araktransfer/home/spell-checkers

Changes made before compiling (details in spell/build-hy.sh):

  - index.aff: a "." condition added to the seven rules in suffix block GX
    that have none; IGNOREEXTRA added; the VD block's rule count corrected
    from 171 to 172.
  - index.dic: each entry spelled with "եւ" duplicated with the ligature "և".

